Detailed macro and nutrient breakdown per meal

Progress & Reports
Visual charts for intake and nutrient trends
Weekly summary cards and highlights
Export detailed meal reports as PDF
Monitor daily intake versus your personal target

Personal Profile & Goals
Set daily targets and personal goals
Log key readings and track progress over time
AI-powered calorie goal calculator

AI Coach
Multi-thread AI chat for day-to-day guidance
Recommendations based on your logged meals, patterns, profile, and activity
Practical coaching focused on real daily decisions

Physical Activity
Step tracking with distance and calorie estimates
Full exercise library with guided routines
Activity stats with badges, streaks, and weekly progress

Story-Based Walking Motivation
Audio stories that unlock as you reach step goals
Music for workouts

Reminders & Notifications
Configurable daily reminders for hydration, check-ins, and meal timing
Weekly summary and activity alerts

Community & News
Curated news feed
Browse, upvote, and comment on community requests
Refer friends and earn rewards

Subscriptions & Credits
Free usage with limited analyses
Paid plans and credit packs for higher usage
